    <h1>How to Calculate the ROI of Test Automation</h1>
    <p class="post-hero-lead">Test automation ROI is not just about time saved on manual testing. The real value is in defects caught earlier, faster release cycles, and developer time reclaimed from production firefighting.</p>
    <div class="post-hero-author">
